<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">Zakaria</book>
  <para style="h">Zakaria</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zakaria</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zakaria</para>
  <para style="mt">Zakaria</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Daria lal kum hnihna, thla riatnaah chuan Ido-a fa, Barakia fapa zâwlnei Zakaria hnênah Lalpa thu heti hian a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“In thlahtute chungah kei Lalpa hi ka lungni lo hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, an hnênah heti hian va sawi rawh: Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ka lam lo hawi rawh u,’ Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. ‘Kei pawh in lam ka lo hawi ang,’ Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘In thlahtute ang khân awm suh u. Engkim Lalpa chuan zâwlnei hmasate hmangin an hnênah, ‘in sual sim ula, in thil sual tihte bânsan rawh u,’ a tih pawhin an ngaithla duh lo va, an zâwm duh hek lo,’ Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Khawiah nge in thlahtute chu an awm tâk? Zâwlneite pawh an dam kumkhua em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka rawngbâwltu zâwlneite hmanga ka thu leh ka thuruat, in thlahtute ka hrilh chu, an zâwm lo va. Tichuan, an thil sual tihte inhrechhuakin, Engkim Lalpa chuan kan awm dân leh kan thil tih ang zêlin min hrem a nih hi,’ an ti,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Daria lal kum hnihna, thla sâwm leh pakhat, Sebat thla, ni sawmhnih leh pali ni chuan Ido-a fa, Barakia fapa zâwlnei Zakaria hnênah Lalpa thu zânah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai teh, mi pakhat, sakawr sen chunga chuang ka hmu a, ruama hnimbuk zîngah a ding a, a hnung lamah chuan sakawr sen te, a sendâng te, a vâr te an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka pu, hêng hi eng tihna nge?” ka ti a. Vântirhkoh mi betu khân, “Eng tihna nge ka han entîr ang che,” tiin mi chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, hnimbuk zînga ding chuan, “Hêng hi lei pum pui fang chhuak tûra Lalpa mi tirh an ni,” tiin a lo chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa tirhkoh, hnimbuk zînga dingte chuan, “Lei pum pui kan fang chhuak a, khawvêl pum pui hian ṭanpui an ngai hle a, an chau hle tih kan hmu,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa tirhkoh chuan, “Engkim Lalpan kum sawmsarih chhûng i lo thinursan tawh Jerusalem leh Judai ram khawpuite hi eng chen nge lainat lova i awm dâwn?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Vântirhkoh mi betu kha thlamuanawm takin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Vântirhkoh mi betu chuan ka hnênah, “He thu hi puang rawh, Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Jerusalem leh Zion chu ka lainat takzet asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rei lo tê ka mite chunga ka thinur chhûngin hnam dangten an lo tuartîr nghek mai a, nuamtâwl mai mai chîng ṭhîn hnam chungah chuan ka lungni lo takzet a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Jerusalem chu ka lainat êm a, ka kîr leh ang a, ka in pawh ka tungding leh ang,’ ” Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Jerusalem chu din thar leh a ni ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka khawpuite chu a hmuingîlin an lo vul leh ang a, Lalpa chuan Zion tlâng chu thlamuang takin a awmtîr ang a, Jerusalem chu a thlang leh ta, tiin puang rawh,” mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka han dâk a, ka han hawi vêl a; ngai teh, ki pali ka hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vântirhkoh mi betu hnênah chuan, “Hêng hi eng tihna nge?” ka ti a. Ani chuan, “Hêng kite hi Juda te, Israel te, Jerusalem-te tiduhdahtu tûr an nih hi,” tiin min chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan thîrdêng pali min hmuhtîr leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Hêng hi eng ti tûra lo kal nge an nih?” ka ti a. Ani chuan, “Ding chhuak thei tawh lo tûr khawpa Judai ram tichhiaa, a mite phîn darhtu hnamte chu tizâm tûr leh tudawl tûrin hêng mite hi an lo kal a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka han dâk a, ka han hawi vêl a, mi pakhat, tehna hrui keng ka hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Khawiah nge i kal dâwn?” ka ti a. Ani chuan, “Jerusalem zau zawng ka teh dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh mi betu kha a kal sawn a, vântirhkoh dangin a rawn tâwk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a hnênah, “Tlân la, tlangvâl hnênah chuan heti hian ti rawh: ‘A chhûngah mipui leh ranrual an tam êm êm dâwn a, Jerusalem khawpui chu hung rual a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei hi a tân mei bang ka ni ang a, kei ngei hi a tiropuitu tûr chu ka ni,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Khaih, khaih, khaih! Hmâr lam ata kha lo chhuak teh u,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Hmun tinah ka hnawt darh che u a,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang pawh Zion, Babulon mite zîng ata lo tlân chhuak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Chuvângin, nangmahni tichhetu hnam chu ka do dâwn a ni,” A ti tih sawi tûrin Ropuia chuan mi tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh, anni chu ka kut ka thin khum ang a, An chhiahhlawh ni ṭhînte chuan an rawk ang. Chutih hunah chuan Engkim Lalpa chuan mi tîr tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Zion, hlim takin au vak vak rawh, Ngai teh, in hnêna chêng tûrin ka lo kal e,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan hnam tam takin Lalpa an bêl ang a, A mite an ni ang. In hnênah a chêng ang a, Tichuan, Engkim Lalpa chuan in hnênah min tîr tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judai ram chu Lalpa pual, ram thianghlim a ni leh ang a, Jerusalem pawh ama tân a thlang leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa hmaah chuan mi tin ngawi ṭhiap rawh u, Ani chu a hmun thianghlim aṭangin a lo chhuak dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa tirhkoh hmaa ding, puithiam lalber Josua leh amah khingtu tûr Setana, a ding lama ding chu mi entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa tirhkoh chuan Setana hnênah, “Nang, Setan, Lalpan hau che rawh se; a ni, Jerusalem thlangtu Lalpa chuan hau che rawh se. He mi hi mei ata thingthu lâk chhuah mai a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Josua chu Vântirhkoh hmaah a ding a, a silhfên chu a bâl hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vântirhkoh chuan a hmaa dingte hnênah, “A silhfên bâl kha hlihsak rawh u,” a ti a. A hnênah chuan, “En teh, i khawlohna ka la bo va, silhfên faiin ka thuam dâwn che hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hnênah, “Diar vâr khimtîr rawh u,” a ti leh a. Tichuan, diar vâr an khimtîr a, silhfên tharin an thuam ta a; Lalpa tirhkoh pawh chu ka kiangah a ding reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa tirhkoh chuan Josua chu khûn takin thu a chah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka kawngte i zawh zêl a, ka thupêkte i zawm chuan, Ka in leh a kawtzâwlte i kutah a awm ang a, Heta dingte zîngah hian i tel thei ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang Puithiam lalber Josua, I thawhpui, i kianga awmte pawhin ngaithla rawh se, Ka chhiahhlawh Chawrnova chu ka rawn tîr dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Josua hmaa lung pakhat ka dah chu en teh, Tah chuan hmai pasarih a awm a, Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak hetianga ziak hi a chuang: ‘He ram sualna hi ni khat thil thuah ka la bo vang a.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Chumi ni chuan mi tinin an ṭhenawmte chu an grep leh theipui buk hnuaia ṭhu tûrin an sâwm ang,” Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vântirhkoh mi betu kha a lo kal leh a, muhîl kaihthawh ang maiin mi rawn kai tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Eng nge i hmuh le?” min ti a. Kei chuan, “Rangkachak hlîra siam khâwnvâr dahna ṭhuam sarih nei, a hmâwra hriak bâwm hmui nei ṭheuh ka hmu,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kiangah Oliv thing pahnih a awm a, pakhat chu a ding lamah, pakhat a vei lamah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vântirhkoh min betu hnênah chuan, “Ka pu, hêng hi eng tihna nge?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Hêng hi eng tihna nge i hre lo maw?” mi ti a. “Hre lo, ka pu,” tiin ka chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, ka hnênah heti hian a sawi: “Jerubabela hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu hei hi a ni: I chakna ni lovin, i thiltihtheihna ni hek lovin Ka Thlarau zâwkin le,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw nang, dâltu tiang lian, eng nge i nih le? Jerubabela hmaah chuan râwt mâm vek i ni ang, Tempul sak zawhna lung hnuhnûng ber a rem hunah, Mipui chu, “A mawi mang e, a mawi mang e,” Tiin an au dur dur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian min bia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Jerubabelan Tempul lung a phûma, a kuta a sak zawh hun chuan Engkim Lalpa chuan an hnênah ka tîr che tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tempul sak hna a chak loh avânga zak ta chu Jerubabelan sahal khaia hna a chhunzawm an hmuh chuan an lâwm hle ang, hêng khâwnvâr dahna pasarih hi Lalpa mit, khawvêl pum pui thlîr ṭhîntu chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “Hêng Oliv thing pahnih, khâwnvâr dahna ding lam leh vei lama awmte hi engtihna nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rangkachak hriak bâwm hmui nei sîr tuaka oliv zâr pahnihte hi engtihna nge?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hêng hi engtihna nge i hre lo maw?” min ti a. Kei chuan, ‘Hre lo, ka pu,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hêng hi mi pahnih, lei pum puia Lalpa rawngbâwl tûra thlante chu an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka han dâk a, ka han hawi vêl a, lehkhabu zial thlâwk duai duai ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Eng nge i hmuh?” a ti a. Kei chuan, “Lehkhabu zial thlâwk duai duai lai ka hmu, tawng sawmhniha sei, tawng sâwma hlai a ni,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hei hi ram puma thleng tûr ânchhe ziakna a ni. A phêk lehlam hi rûkru zawng zawng tihboralna tûr thu ziakna a ni a, a lehlam hi chhechham apiang tihboralna tûr thu ziakna a ni bawk.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka tîr chhuak ang a, rûkru inah te, ka hminga dâwta chhechham ṭhîn inahte ka thlawh luhtîr ang. Tah chuan, a awm reng ang a, chu in hmanrua, thing leh lungte chu a tichhe vek ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vântirhkoh mi betu kha a lo kal leh a, “Dâk la, han en vêl teh, eng nge i hmuh le?” mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Eng nge lo lang ta hi?” ka ti a. Ani chuan, “Hei hi bâwm, tehnaa hman tûr chu a ni; lei pum pui sualzia tihlanna tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bâwm chhîn chu suan phêk a ni a; a han hawng a, bâwm chhûngah chuan hmeichhia a lo ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hei hi Sualbûri a ni,” a ti a. Tichuan, bâwmah chuan a nem lût leh a, suan phêk chuan a chhîn leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka han dâk chhuak a, ngai teh, hmeichhe pahnih an lo lang a, thlain an lo thlâwk a, an thla chu vacha thla ang a ni. Bâwm chu lei leh vân inkârah an thlawhpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vântirhkoh mi betu hnênah chuan, “Khawiah nge bâwm chu an thlawhpui dâwn?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Babulon ramah in an saksak dâwn a, an peih hunah ama awmna tûra an ruatah chuan an dah ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka han dâk leh a, sakawr-tawlailîr pali, tlâng lian pui pui inkâr aṭanga lo chhuak ka hmu a, tlângte chu dâr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tawlailîr pakhat chu sakawr sen rualin an hnûk a, pakhat chu a dumin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />pakhat chu a vârin, a dang leh chu a rângin. An chak êm êm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi betu hnênah chuan, “Ka pu, hêng hi engtihna nge?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vântirhkoh chuan, “Hêng hi vân thli pali, lei pum pui Lalpa hmaa inring renga awm ṭhîn, kal chhuak an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sakawr sente chu khawchhak lama kal tûr an ni a, a dumte chu hmâr lamah, a vârte chu khawthlang lamah, a rângte chu chhim lamah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An lo per chhuak ṭek ṭek a, khawvêl fan chhuah an nghâkhlel hle a ni. An hnênah, “Kal ta ula, khawvêl fang chhuak rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, an fang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan mi han au va, “Ngai teh, hmâr lama kalte chuan hmâr lam ram chungchânga ka thinur an tidai ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah hetiang hian a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Saltângte thilpêk, Heldaia te, Tobija te, Jedaia te rawn ken chu la la, Babulon aṭanga lo thleng Zefania fapa Josia hnênah kalpui nghâl rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tangkarua leh rangkachak chu la la, lallukhum siam la, Jehozadaka fapa Josua, puithiam lalber chu khumtîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hnênah heti hian ti ang che: ‘Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Mi pakhat, Chawrnova an tih chu, a awmhmun lei aṭangin a chawr chhuak ang a, Lalpa Tempul a sa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah ngei hi a ni Lalpa Tempul satu tûr chu. Lal ropuinain a inthuam ang a, lalṭhutthlêngah a ṭhu ang. A ding lamah puithiam a ṭhu ang a, an lungrual hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lallukhum chu Lalpa Tempulah, Helema te, Tobija te, Jedaia te, Zefania fapa Josia te hriatrengna tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa Tempul sa tûrin ram hla tak ata an lo kal ang a, Engkim Lalpa chuan in hnênah min tîr tih in hria ang. In Pathian, Lalpa thu in zawm phawt chuan hêng thil hi a lo thleng ngei ang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Daria lal kum lina thla kuana, Kislev thla ni li ni-ah Lalpan Zakaria chu a bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bethel mite chuan Sarezara te, Regenmeleka te leh an hote chu Lalpa malsâwmna dîl tûrin an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa ina puithiam leh zâwlneite hnênah chuan, “Kum tam tak kan lo tih tawh ṭhin angin thla nganaah hian Tempul chhiat sûnin chaw kan nghei zêl ang em?” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ram chhûng mipuite leh puithiamte chu zâwt teh u. Hêng kum sawmsarih chhûng, thla ngana leh thla sarihnaa Tempul sûna chaw in ngheite khân, ka tâna chaw nghei in ni meuh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In ei a, in in pawhin in pumpuarna mai a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem leh a chhehvêl khuaahte mi an bit êm êm lai, chhim lam ram leh tlâng bulṭhut phairuamah te mi an awm noh noh lai pawh khân Lalpa chuan hêng thu bawk hi a ni lâwm ni zâwlnei hmasate hmanga a sawi ṭhin kha?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa thu Zakaria hnênah chuan hetiang hian a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Dik takin ro rêl ula, Inkhawngaihin inlainat tawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmeithai te, fahrah te, hnam dang te, Pachhia te hnehchhiah suh u. Mi dang tâna pawi tûr eng mah Ngaihtuah chhuak suh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, an ngaithla duh lo va, An tukkhum chhah an chhawn a, An hriat theih loh nân beng an hup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Engkim Lalpan zâwlnei hmasate hmanga a pêk, Dân leh thupêk ngaithla lo tûrin an thinlung chu lung angin an tisak a, Chuvângin, Engkim Lalpa chu a thinur takzet a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka ko va, an hre duh lo va, Min koh pawhin ka hre duh bîk lo vang,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hriat ngai loh hnam dang zîngah, Ṭhâwngaleivir ka lâktîr ang a, An chhuahsan ram chu a ṭiau ang a, Tu man an tlawh lo vang. Ram nuam tak chu thlalêr ram rovah an chantîr ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah hetiangin a lo thleng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Zion chu vei takzetin ka vei a ni. A chunga thinur khawpin asin ka thîk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Zion-ah ka lo kîr ang a, Jerusalem-ah ka chêng reng tawh ang. Engkim Lalpa tlâng pawh Tlâng Thianghlim an ti ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Jerusalem kawtthlêrahte chuan pitar leh putar tiang hawl, Upa tak tak an ṭhu leh fer fur ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khawpui tual zau laiahte naupang an tualchai nuk nuk ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Tûna la dam chhunte tân chu chu thil mak lutuk a nih pawhin, Ka tân a mak ve dâwn em ni?” Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh u, ka mite chu chhak leh thlang ata Ka hruai khâwm dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem luah tûrin ka hruai haw ang, Ka mite an ni ang a, kei pawh an Pathian, Rinawm tak leh dik taka rorêlsaktu ka ni ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Engkim Lalpa Tempul lungphûm an phûm laia Zâwlnei thu sawi kha hre reng ula, In sa zo tûrin ṭan la rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tûn hma kha chuan mihring leh ran hlawh tûr a awm lo va, Hmêlmate avângin vâk chhuak ngam an awm hek lo. Mi tin ka inhmêlmâktîr vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A la awm chhunte tân tûn hma kha ka ang dâwn tawh lo,” Tih hi Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ralmuang takin thlai an chîng ang a, An grepte pawh a rah tiar tuar ang a, An thlai chînte a lo hlâwk ang a, Vân daifîmin a châwm ang. A la awm chhunte chu hêng malsâwmna hian ka vûr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnam dangten ânchhia an lawh ṭhîn che u a, Nangni Juda leh Israel-te u, Hnam dangten in zâr an zo theih nân, Ka chhan chhuak dâwn a che u; Hlau suh u, ṭan la sauh sauh rawh u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In thlahtuten min tihthinur lai ang khân, Lainat lovin chhiatna in chungah thlentîr ka lo tum tawh a,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Amaherawhchu, Jerusalem leh Juda chungah Thil ṭha thlentîr ka tum ta zâwk asin, Hlau suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hêng hi in tihtûr chu a ni: Thu dik inhrilhtawn ula, In rorêlna hmunah dik takin rêl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Intihchhiat tawn tum suh u, Dâwta chhechham chîng hek suh u, Chûng chu ka huatzâwng tak a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah hetiangin a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Thla linaah te, thla nganaah te, thla sarihnaah te, Thla sâwmnaah te chaw in nghei ṭhîn a, Chu chu Juda chhûngte tân Kût hlimawm leh lâwmawm a ni tawh ang. Chuvângin, thu dik ngaina ula, remna zawng rawh u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Khawpui tam tak aṭangin mi an lo kal duah duah ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khaw khata mite khaw danga kalin, ‘Hawh u, Lalpa be tûrin i kal ang u, Engkim Lalpa ka pan dâwn, Lo tel ve rawh u,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa be tûr leh a malsâwmna dîl tûrin mi tam tak leh hnam thiltithei takte chu, Jerusalem-ah an lo kal dâwn a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Chutih hunah chuan hnam tin leh ṭawng tin zînga mi sâwm An lo kal ang a, Juda pakhat kawrfual vuan chungin ‘In zîngah kan tel ve dâwn, Lalpa chu in hnênah a awm tih kan hria a ni,’ an ti ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hadrak leh Damaska chunga thleng tûr chungchânga Lalpa thu chu: Mite mit chuan Lalpa a thlîr a, Israel hnamte pawhin an thlîr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An ram ṭhenawm Hamat te, Tura te, Sidon khawpui te chu, an finnate chawpin a ta vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tura chuan kulh a siam a, Vaivut ang maiin tangkarua a chhûng khâwm a, Rangkachak pawh kawtthlêr chirhdiak angin a chhêk khâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mahse, Lalpan a thil neihte a chhuhsak ang a, A hausakna chu tuipuiah a paih ang a, khawpui chu a kâng ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Askelon khuain an hmu ang a, an hlau vang, Gaza khua pawh hlauvin an khûr ang a, Ekron khua pawh an beidawng ang. Gaza khuaah lal chu a boral ang a, Askelon khua chu a ram ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asdod chu sâwnin a luah ang a, Hnam chapo Filistia chu ka titlâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thisen nên sa an ei tawh lo vang a, Sa thiang lo an ei tawh hek lo vang. Thi bângte chu kan Pathian ta an ni ang a, Juda hnam ang an ni ang. Ekron mite pawh Jebus mite ang an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sipai lo kal lakah ka in chu ka vêng tlat ang a, Hnehchhiahtuten an paltlang tawh ngai lo vang, Tûnah zawng ka vêng tlat tawh dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Zion fanu, lâwm hle la, Aw Jerusalem fanu, hlim takin au rawh, En teh, i lal chu i hnênah a lo kal a, Mi dik tak a ni a, Chhandamtu a ni. Tlâwm takin sabengtung chungah a chuang a, A ni, sabengtung no chungah chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Efraim indona tawlailîr leh Jerusalem sakawrte chu a tiral ang, Hnam tin a inremtîr ang a, A ram chu tuipui aṭanga tuifinriat thleng,. Luipui aṭanga kâwlkil thleng a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang erawh chu, kan inkâra thisen thuthlung avângin, Khuarkhurum rova i mi tângte chu ka chhuah vek a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangni, mi tâng, chhuah beiseite u, In kulh lamah kîr leh ang che u, Ka hrilh a che u, in tuar man chu A lêt hnihin ka rûl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda chu thalngul atân ka hmang a, Efraim chu thal atân, Grik mite dona tûrin Zion fate chu ka chawk tho vang a, Mi huaisen khandaih angin ka hmang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chu an chung lamah a lo lang a, A thal chu kâwlphe angin a de zawr zawr ang. Lalpa P athian chuan tawtawrâwt a hâm ang a, Chhim thlipui na angin a lo thawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan anni chu a hum ang a, An hmêlmate chu an hneh ang a, Kulh denna lungte chu an chîl ang. An hmêlmate thisenin an rui ang a, An au chêlchûl ang. Maichâm kila thisen tah a luang zuih ang leh Chawhtawlha liam zawih zawih ang hi a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan Lalpa , An Pathian chuan berâm angin A mite chu a chhanhim ang a, Lallukhuma lunghlute angin a ramah chuan an êng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An va ṭhain an va mawi êm! An buh chu tlangvâlten an ṭhat phah ang a, An uain chu nulaten an mawi phah ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Khua a khenin Lalpa churuah dîl ula, Lalpa chuan chhûm te, kâwlphe te a siam a, Thlai tinrêng ruah a châwmtîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Milemte chuan thil ho mai mai an sawi a, Aien thiamte thil hmuh pawh chu eng mah a ni lo. Mumang dik lo an mang a, Dâwtin mi an thlamuan thlâwn a, Chuvângin, mipuite chu berâm angin an darh a, Vêngtu nei lovin hrehawm an tuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Berâmpute chungah chuan ka thinur takzet a ni, Hruaitute chu ka hrem ngei dâwn. Engkim Lalpa chuan a berâm Juda-te chu a ngaihsak a, Indo nâna a sakawr chhuan angin a tichak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kil lung te, khen marna thîr te, indona thalngul te, Rorêltute an zîng aṭangin an lo chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chu indonaa mi chak tak an ni ang a, Kawtthlêr chirhdiak angin hmêlmate an chîl ang, Lalpa an hnêna a awm avângin an bei nasa mai ang, Sakawr chunga chuang mite pawh an hneh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Juda chhûngte chu ka tichak ang a, Josefa chhûngte chu ka chhanhim ang, Anni chu ka lainat êm a, ka hruai kîr leh ang a, Hnawh chhuah la ni ngai lo ang an ni ang. Kei Lalpa , an Pathian hi an dîlna chhâng ṭhîntu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Efraim mite chu mi huai rual angin an chak ang a, Uain in ṭhînte angin an hlim ang. An faten an chakzia an hre reng ang a, An thiltih avângin Lalpa chu an chhuang hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anni chu faifûkin ka ko khâwm ang, Ka tlan tawh sate an ni si a, Tûn hma ang khân an pung leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnam dang zîngah hnawt darh mah ila, Ram hla tak aṭang pawhin min hre reng ang. Anni chu an fate nên dam takin An lo haw tlâng leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭangin ka hruai kîr leh ang a, Asuria ram aṭangin ka khâwm ang. Gilead ramah leh Lebanon-ah ka hruai lût ang a, Chûngah pawh chuan an leng chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuifâwn pawh a reh ang a, Nail lui thûk laite pawh a kang chat ang a, Hnam chapo Asuria chu a tlâwm ang a, Aigupta ram lal pawh a tlâwm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa hmingin ka mite chu ka tichak ang a, A hming chu an rinchhan ber a ni ang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lebanon, i kawngkhâr hawng rawh, I sidar thingte a kâng dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw, nang fâr thinglian, ṭap la, chiau vawng vawng rawh, Sidar thingte a tlu vek tawh a, Thing lian pui puite pawh a tlu zo ta. Basan rama sasuate u, ṭap vawng vawng rawh u, Ngaw dur pui chu an ṭhiat zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Berâmpute au thâwm tak chu aw! An ropuina a chuai ta si a. Sakeibaknei mangang rûm thâwm chu ngaithla teh u, An chênna Jordan ruamte pawh a chereu zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka Pathian, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ran talh tûrte chu châwm thau ula, A talhtuten khawngaih hauh lovin talh rawh se, A hralhtute chuan, ‘ Lalpa i fak ang u, Kan hausak tâk hi,’ an ti a, Berâmpute lahin an lainat hauh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“He ram mite hi ka khawngaih dâwn tawh lo,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Mite chu a ṭhenawm ram leh chûnga lalte hnênah chuan ka hlân ang a, ram chu an tiṭiau vek ang, an kut ata anni chu ka chhan lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, berâm zuartute tân ranrual talh tûrte chu ka vulh a. Tiang pahnih ka la a, pakhat chu ‘Duhawm’ ka vuah a, a dang chu ‘Phuarkhâwmna’ ka vuah bawk a, ranrual chu ka enkawl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thla khat chhûngin berâmpu pathumte chu ka bân a, anni chu ka hua a, anni pawhin min hua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, an hnênah, ‘In vêngtu ka ni tawh hlei nêm; a thi chu thi ula, a boral pawh boral mai rawh u; a dam chhunte pawh intiboral tawn mai rawh u,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnam tin tâna ka thuthlung chu ka ṭhiat ta tih entîr nân ka tiang ‘Duhawm’ chu ka la a, ka titliak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi ni-a tiang ka titliak chu ran zuartute chuan min thlîr reng a, ka thiltih chu Lalpa thu-a ti ka ni tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An hnênah, ‘âwm in tih leh ka hlawh min pe ula, in tih loh leh min pe lo ula,’ ka ti a. Tichuan, chêng sawmthum min pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Ka man atâna tâwk hlea an hriat chu bêlvawtu pe rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, chêng sawmthum chu ka la a, Lalpa tân bêlvawtu chu ka pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka tiang dang, ‘Phuarkhâwmna’ chu ka titliak leh a, Juda leh Israel inzawmna chu a chat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Berâmpu tlâktlailo hmanrua chu la la, a ai va awh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai teh, ranrual enkawltuah, Ran chungah ani chu ka dah a, A bote a zawng lo va, a notête a ngaihsak lo; A hliamte a enkawl lo va, Tla thei lote a châwm hek lo, A thau thau a ei a, An tin lam a khâwng thlawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Berâmpu tlâktlailo, a berâm thlahthlamtu chu A chung a pik e. A bân ding lam leh a mit ding lam chu Khandaihin chhun sela, A bân chu zeng rawh se, A mitte pawh del rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel chungchânga Lalpa thuchhuak chu: Vânte kaipharha, leilung nghahchhan phûmtu leh Mihring Thlarau dahtu Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ngai teh, Jerusalem chu a vêla mite tlûkchhiat nân Tawktarhah ka siam ang, Jerusalem an hual hunah Judai ram pawh an hual tel ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Jerusalem bei tûrin khawvêl hnam tin An pung khâwm ang a, Jerusalem chu khawvêla hnam tin tân Tihchêt rual loh lungpuiah ka siam ang. Tihchêt tum apiang an inhliam zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan sakawr zawng zawng ka ṭhâwng darh phut ang a, A chungchuangte pawh an chiai ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Juda chhûngte chu ka vêng tlat ang, Hnam dang indona sakawr mitte ka tidel ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Juda hruaitute chuan, “Engkim Pathian, Lalpa chuan Jerusalem-a a mite chu a tichak ṭhîn,” an ti rilru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan Juda hruaitute chu thingai chunga meivâm dah ang leh buhpâwl zînga meichher alh dah ang an ni ang a, an chhehvêla awm hnam dang, an ding lam leh vei lama mite chu an kâng ral ang a; Jerusalem erawh chu a hmun ngaiah nghet takin a ding reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Judai rama chêngte chu a chhan hmasa ang; tichuan, Davida thlahte pawimawhna leh Jerusalem-a chêngte pawimawhna chuan Judai ram thingtlânga chêngte pawimawhna a khûm loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan Lalpa chuan Jerusalem-a chêngte chu a hum tlat ang a; tichuan, an zînga chak lo ber pawh Davida anga chak a lo ni ang a, Davida chhûngte pawh Pathian ang, an hmaa Lalpa Vântirhkoh awm ṭhînte ang an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan Jerusalem rawn beitu hnamte chu tiboral tûrin ka lo thawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Davida chhûngte leh Jerusalem-a chêngte chu lainatna leh mi duhsak theihna thinlungin ka tikhat ang a, an chhuna chu min en ang a, fa neihchhun sûn ang leh fa tîr fapa sûn ang maiin an lung a chhe hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan Jerusalem ṭap thâwm chu Megido phaia an pathian Hadad-rimona an ṭah thâwm ang maiin a nasa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rama awmte chu a hnam hnamin an ṭap ang; Davida chhûngte leh an nupui te, Nathana thlahte leh an nupui te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Levia thlahte leh an nupui te, Simeia thlahte leh an nupui te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel hnam dang zawng zawng leh an nupuite chu a hrang ṭheuhvin an ṭap ang, mipa leh hmeichhia chu a hrangin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan Davida chhûngte leh Jerusalem-a chêngte sualna leh bawlhhlawhna tlêng fai tûr tui a lo luang chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan ram chhûnga an lam ṭhin milem zawng zawng chu ka tibo vek ang a, an hre reng tawh lo vang, tih hi Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. Zâwlneia inchhâlte leh thlarau bawlhhlawhte chu ram ata ka hnawt bo vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu pawh, zâwlnei anga thu puang lui zêl chu amah hringtu, a nu leh paten a hnênah, “ Lalpa hminga dâwt i sawi avângin i thi ngei tûr a ni,” an ti ang a, amah hringtu a nu leh pa chuan a thu puang lai chu an vit hlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan, chûng zâwlneite chuan an inlârna hmuh chu an zahpui ang a, mi bum nân sahmul kawrfual an ha tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Zâwlnei ka ni lo, ka naupan têt ata lo nei mi ka ni,” a ti zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“A nih, hêng i taksaa pemte hi engtizia nge?” an tih chuan, anin, “Ka ṭhiante inah min tipalh a ni,” a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Harh teh, khandaih, ka berâm vêngtu, Ka thawhpui chu bei rawh,” Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Berâmpu chu vua la, berâmte chu darh rawh se, A note chungah pawh kut ka thlâk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ram chhûngah hetiang thil hi a thleng dâwn a ni,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Mi hmun thuma ṭhena hmun hnih an tlu ang a, an thi ang, Hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu an zuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zuahte chu meiin ka fiah ang a, Tangkarua tihthianghlim angin ka tithianghlim ang a, Rangkachak fiah angin ka fiah ang. Min ko vang a, ka lo chhâng ang, ‘Ka mi in ni,’ ka ti ang a, Annin, ‘ Lalpa , kan Pathian chu i ni,’ min ti ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa ni chu a lo thleng dâwn, râlin in thil an lâk chu in mit hmuhah an insem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem bei tûrin hnam tinrêng ka ko khâwm ang a, khawpui chu an la ang a, inte an tichhe vek ang a, hmeichhiate pawh an pâwngsual ang. Khawpuia mihring zâtve chu salah an hruai ang a, a dang zawng chu khawpuiah an la awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu a lo thawk ang a, indo nia a chêt ṭhin dân angin chûng hnamte chu a rawn bei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan Jerusalem chhak lama Oliv tlângah a ding ang a, Oliv tlâng chu chhak leh thlang hawiin a khi phel phawk ang a, a inkâr ruam chu zau tak a ni ang. Tlâng phel khat chu hmâr lamah a tawlh ang a, a lehlam chu chhim lamah a tawlh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlâng kâr ruamah chuan in biru ang a, tlâng inkâr ruam chuan Azel hmun a thleng ang. Juda lal Uzia lal laia lîrnghîng avânga in tlân ang khân chutah chuan in tlân ang. Tin, Ka Pathian, Lalpa chu, a mi thianghlim zawng zawng nên a lo kal ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan êng a awm lo vang a, khua a vâwtin vûr a tla tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni danglam tak, Lalpa ni an tih chu a lo thleng dâwn, chhûn a awm lo vang a, zân pawh a awm lo vang; tlai thlengin a êng reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan Jerusalem aṭangin tui nung a lo luang chhuak ang a, a zâtve chu Tuipui Thiah a luang lût ang a, a zâtve dang chu Mediteranean tuipuiah a luang lût ang. Fûrah pawh ṭhâlah pawh a kang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chu lei pum pui tân lal a ni ang a, chumi hunah chuan Lalpa chauh an bia ang a, a hming chauh an lam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmâr lam Geba khua aṭangin Jerusalem chhim lama Rimon khaw thlengin ram pum pui chu Araba zâwl angin tihhniam a ni ang a. Jerusalem erawh chu a hmun ngaiah tihsân a ni ang. Khua chuan Benjamin kawngka aṭanga kawngka pakhatna, a kil kawngka an tih leh Hanania in sâng aṭanga lal uain sâwrna hmun an tih thlengin a awh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu chu an luah ang a, rawn tichhe tûr an awm tawh lo vang a, Jerusalem chu him takin a awm reng tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jerusalem dotu hnam zawng zawng chu Lalpa chuan he hri chhia hian a hrem dâwn: Ding chungin an tisa a ṭawih ang a; an mitkhurah an mitmu a keh ang a, an lei chu an ka chhûngah a ṭawih ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan namên lovin Lalpa chuan mite chu a tichiai ang a, mahni hnaih hnaih an man ang a, kut an inthlâk tawn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Juda pawhin Jerusalem tân ṭan a la ang a, an vêla hnam zawng zawng rangkachak te, tangkarua te, thawmhnaw tam tak te an la ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, hmêlmate riahhmuna an sakawr te, sabengtung te, sanghâwngsei te, sabengtung tê chi te leh an ranrual zawng zawng chungah hri chhia chu a lêng bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hnam dang, Jerusalem rawn dotu, la dam zawng zawng chu, Engkim Lalpa chu be tûrin kum tin Bâwkte kût hmangin an lo chho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leia mi zawng zawng, Engkim Lalpa chibai bûk tûra chho duh lote chungah chuan ruah a sûr lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aigupta mite pawh kût hmang tûra an lo chhoh duh loh chuan ruah an hmu lo vang. Bâwkte kûta lo kal duh lo hnam dang a hrem ang khân Lalpa chuan a hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hei hi Aigupta ram hremna leh hnam tin Bâwkte kût hmang duh lote hremna tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chu mi ni chuan sakawr ṭhi-ah pawh ‘ Lalpa tâna serh hran’ tih a chuang ang a; Lalpa ina bungbêlte pawh maichâm hmaa maihûn angin a thianghlim tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerusalem leh Judai rama bungbêl awm zawng zawng chu a lo thianghlim tawh ang a, inthawi tûra kalte chuan bêl chu inthawina sa chhum nân an hmang thei tawh ang. Chumi hunah chuan Engkim Lalpa inah chuan sumdâwng tu mah an awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
</usx>
